> "Funny."
> "Nobody sent word down, but it's not very convincing when he's covered in blood and you're covered in blood."
> "Where am I, I'm gonna have to go check, I'm gonna go have to check this story to see if it's real."

**GM** — *offering Zenvon a choice*
> "Are you gonna let him check or are you gonna try to bluff him again?"

